  "title": "Old Fashioned Peach Cobbler",
  "description": "This old-fashioned peach cobbler recipe features flaky, homemade pastry filled with fresh peaches tossed in citrus juice with nutmeg and cinnamon.",
  "authors": [
    "ELETA"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-07-27T12:15:19-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2026-07-29T08:04:28-04:00",
  "prep_time": "PT30M",
  "cook_time": "PT70M",
  "total_time": "PT130M",
  "yield": [
    "18",
    "1 (9x13-inch) cobber"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Dessert"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "U.S."
  ],
  "regions": [
    "U.S."
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "2.5 cups all-purpose flour",
    "4 tablespoons white sugar, divided",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "1 cup shortening",
    "1 large egg",
    "0.25 cup cold water",
    "1 tablespoon butter, melted",
    "3 pounds fresh peaches - peeled, pitted, and sliced",
    "0.75 cup orange juice",
    "0.25 cup lemon juice",
    "0.5 cup butter",
    "2 cups white sugar",
    "1 tablespoon cornstarch",
    "1 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground nutmeg"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather the ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/i1YHXQR-B6oXfk8NAkE0KWOrTpo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/19897-old-fashioned-peach-cobbler-VAT-step-01-60194f38801a4c878bf0600b4df40675.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19897/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the crust: Sift flour, 3 tablespoons sugar, and salt together in a medium bowl. Work in shortening with a pastry blender until mixture resembles coarse crumbs.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aCvFBos2eQhZQShUXjU5kusfkpk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/19897-old-fashioned-peach-cobbler-VAT-step-02-db3f686ffd3b409e98b96032462d0021.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19897/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk egg and cold water together in a small bowl. Sprinkle over flour mixture; work with hands to form dough into a ball. Wrap with plastic wrap and chill in the refrigerator for 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iFwtFMX1MKlNXETHu8jxQ_Lopz0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/19897-old-fashioned-peach-cobbler-VAT-step-03-f576733061e24472a206812502e77a97.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19897/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Roll out 1/2 of the chilled dough to 1/8-inch thickness.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Q11TY-TT1pc1vCckaw2nKwFJ1TQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/19897-old-fashioned-peach-cobbler-VAT-step-04-9ce65516cd4047a291a681d2aae7c0d8.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19897/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place in a 9x13-inch baking dish, covering the bottom and halfway up the sides. Bake in the preheated oven until golden brown, about 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/vieCXdGjHGLdbkKJENorH7ZJL_U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/19897-old-fashioned-peach-cobbler-VAT-step-05-1892ff4f1926479db570064d0337f0c4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19897/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "To make the filling: Mix peaches, orange juice, and lemon juice in a large saucepan. Add butter and cook over medium-low heat until butter is melted.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0aYAptsqH2KAngVCUAemimGskWU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/19897-old-fashioned-peach-cobbler-VAT-step-06-4988d4edf2ca4c14b5faa3241a540ab5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19897/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir sugar, cornstarch, cinnamon, and nutmeg together in a bowl; mix into peach mixture until combined. Pour into baked crust.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LxmuHjBiilUMFSfSdUcTIzxlqAs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/19897-old-fashioned-peach-cobbler-VAT-step-07-94a5e8849160425281266790decfa51e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19897/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll remaining dough to 1/4-inch thickness. Cut into 1/2-inch-wide strips.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/HFnVGf7feqM43Lj8_h6CH0WCY04=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/19897-old-fashioned-peach-cobbler-VAT-step-08-d6bed0af5f3c423ead572579efe62887.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19897/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Weave strips into a lattice over peaches. Sprinkle with 1 tablespoon sugar, then drizzle with melted butter.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/hfiAg9ClCkJfTt6j-7uFsCyIl_0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/19897-old-fashioned-peach-cobbler-VAT-step-09-b19468bf18af4fac8dba94352d5d7279.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19897/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until top crust is golden brown, 35 to 40 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Qe9O1bwbml_IMTSFySarbCTgYtU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/19897-old-fashioned-peach-cobbler-VAT-step-10-998e48a5afe644f58e07a2772af6bfdc.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19897/step_10.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/nQ1HumhmRHhcsywZJwmvD8l85Vg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/19897-old-fashioned-peach-cobbler-VAT-4x3-7655b94b8cea47a8bee1a1adc5d42ef3.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/19897/step_11.webp"
    }
  ],
